{"title":{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"树链剖分"}]},"ast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"算法简介"}],"identifier":"heading-算法简介"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"树链剖分是将树上的节点映射到一段连续的区间中，使得树上任意一条路径能用不超过 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"O(\\log N)~"},{"type":"text","value":" 段连续区间表示。这样，利用线段树就可以在 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"O(\\log^2 N)"},{"type":"text","value":" 的时间复杂度对树上任意路径上的节点进行维护和查询了。"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"算法原理"}],"identifier":"heading-算法原理"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"marker":42,"spread":false,"children":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"siz(u)"},{"type":"text","value":": 以 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 为根的子树的节点数"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"son(u)"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 的子节点中 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"siz"},{"type":"text","value":" 值最大的节点"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"重边"}]},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"son(u)"},{"type":"text","value":" 的连边"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"轻边"}]},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 与除 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"son(u)"},{"type":"text","value":" 外其它子节点的连边"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"重链"}]},{"type":"text","value":": 由重边连成的路径"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"定理1"}],"identifier":"heading-定理1"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"如果 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"(u,v)"},{"type":"text","value":" 是一条轻边，那么 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\displaystyle siz(v) < \\frac{siz(u)}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"因为 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"(u,v)"},{"type":"text","value":" 是一条轻边，所以 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 还有一个由重边相连的儿子 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"son(u)"},{"type":"text","value":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"text","value":"\n若 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\displaystyle siz(v) \\geqslant \\frac{siz(u)}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，根据定义，有 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\displaystyle siz \\big( son(u) \\big) \\geqslant siz(v) \\geqslant \\frac{siz(u)}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"text","value":"\n与 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\displaystyle siz(u) \\geqslant siz(v)+siz \\big( son(u) \\big) +1 > 2 \\times siz(v)"},{"type":"text","value":" 矛盾。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"text","value":"\n故，"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\displaystyle siz(v) < \\frac{siz(u)}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"定理2"}],"identifier":"heading-定理2"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"任意非根节点 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 到根节点的路径上，"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"轻边"}]},{"type":"text","value":"+"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"重链"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 总数不超过 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"O(\\log_2 N)"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"不难证明，最多会遇到 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\log_2 N"},{"type":"text","value":" 条"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"轻边"}]},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"text","value":"\n因为从根节点到 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 的路径中，每遇到一条"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"轻边"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，节点个数就会减半，"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"text","value":"\n所以轻边的数目不超过 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\log_2 N"},{"type":"text","value":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"text","value":"\n而整条路径上 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\log_2 N"},{"type":"text","value":" 条"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"轻边"}]},{"type":"text","value":"最多隔开 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\log_2 N +1"},{"type":"text","value":" 条"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"重链"}]},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"text","value":"\n故，"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"轻边"}]},{"type":"text","value":"+"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"重链"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 总数不超过 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"O(\\log_2 N)"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"由 "},{"type":"linkReference","identifier":"定理2","label":"定理2","referenceType":"collapsed","children":[{"type":"text","value":"定理2"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 可知当我们将一棵树沿着重链剖分后，将重链依次映射到一段连续的区间后，就可以将任何一条到根的链分成 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\log N"},{"type":"text","value":" 段连续区间了。也就是用 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\log N"},{"type":"text","value":" 条重链的覆盖这一条路径。"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"算法实现"}],"identifier":"heading-算法实现"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"marker":42,"spread":false,"children":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"fat(u)"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 的父亲"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"son(u)"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 的子节点中 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"siz"},{"type":"text","value":" 值最大的节点"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"dep(u)"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 的深度，根节点深度为 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"1"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"siz(u)"},{"type":"text","value":": 以 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 为根的子树的节点数"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"pos(u)"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 在连续区间的映射值"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"top(u)"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 所在重链的顶端节点"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"marker":42,"spread":true,"children":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"求出 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"siz,dep,son,fat"}]},{"type":"code","lang":"cpp","meta":"title=\"dfs1.cpp\" linenos","value":"int fat[MAXN], son[MAXN], dep[MAXN], siz[MAXN];\nvoid dfs(int o, int f, int d) {\n  fat[o] = f; son[o] = 0;\n  dep[o] = d; siz[o] = 1;\n  for (int u = from[o]; u; u = nxt[u]) {\n    int v = to[u];\n    if (v == f) continue;\n    dfs(v, o, d+1);\n    siz[o] += siz[v];\n    if (siz[son[o]] < siz[v]) son[o] = v;\n  }\n}\n"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"求出 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"top, pos"},{"type":"text","value":"，"}]},{"type":"code","lang":"cpp","meta":"title=\"dfs2.cpp\" linenos","value":"int top[MAXN], pos[MAXN], dfs_clock;\nvoid dfs(int u, int t) {\n  pos[u] = ++dfs_clock;\n  top[u] = t;\n  if (!son[u]) return;\n\n  // u 与 son(u) 在同一条重链上，故重链的顶端节点相同\n  dfs(son[u], t);\n\n  for (int i = from[u]; i; i = nxt[i]) {\n    int v = to[i];\n\n    // u 的其它非 son(u) 子节点为新的重链的顶端节点\n    if (v != fat[u] && v != son[u]) dfs(v, v);\n  }\n}\n"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"树链剖分完了！！怎么用呢？如下图所示，粗线表示重边，虚线表示轻边，黑色数字为节点编号，紫色数字为边编号。图中的 "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"0"},{"type":"text","value":" 节点为一虚拟节点，引进它是方便理解下文\n"},{"type":"footnoteReference","label":"1","identifier":"footnote-1"},{"type":"text","value":"。每条边上的紫色数字表示箭头所指的节点的 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"pos"},{"type":"text","value":" 值。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"imageReference","identifier":"1.png","label":"1.png","referenceType":"collapsed","alt":"1.png"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"对于树上的两个节点 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":"，若它们的最近公共祖先（LCA）为 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"w"},{"type":"text","value":"；那么，如果我们想要对路径 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"(u,v)"},{"type":"text","value":" 上的所有节点进行一个操作，只需要让 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":","},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":" 同时沿着各自的祖先节点走，并在 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"w"},{"type":"text","value":" 处相遇就可以了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"top"},{"type":"text","value":" 是为了加速往上走的过程；但是不难发现，由于每次可能不仅走一步，如果 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":" 同时行动的话，很可能会错过 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"w"},{"type":"text","value":" ！为了解决这个问题，可以总是让 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"dep(top)"},{"type":"text","value":" 值大的点先走（想一想，为什么）。"}]},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"不妨假设 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"dep \\big( top(u) \\big) \\geqslant dep \\big( top(v) \\big)"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"marker":42,"spread":false,"children":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"text","value":"若 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"top(u) \\neq top(v)"},{"type":"text","value":"，则得到一段连续的映射区间\n"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\Big[pos \\big( top(u) \\big),pos(u)\\Big]"},{"type":"text","value":"；让 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 走到 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"fat \\big( top(u) \\big)"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"text","value":"否则 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"top(u) = top(v)"},{"type":"text","value":"，即 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":" 在同一条重链中。显然，\n"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"w = \\Big\\{ x \\big\\vert dep(x) = \\min \\big\\lbrace dep(y) \\vert y \\in \\{ u, v \\} \\big\\},\\; x \\in \\{ u, v \\} \\Big\\}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得到一段连续的映射区间 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\Big[ pos(w),pos \\big( \\{u,v\\} - \\{w\\} \\big) \\Big]"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"由于每次走到 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"fat(top)"},{"type":"text","value":"，可以放心的把轻边当做长度为 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"0"},{"type":"text","value":" 的"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"重链"}]},{"type":"text","value":"来处理。比如，我们现在要访问 "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"节点6"},{"type":"text","value":" --> "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"节点15"},{"type":"text","value":" 的路径："}]},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"list","ordered":true,"orderType":"1","start":1,"marker":46,"spread":false,"children":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 走到 "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"12"},{"type":"text","value":"，得到一段连续的映射区间 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"[7,7]"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"u"},{"type":"text","value":" 走到 "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"1"},{"type":"text","value":"，得到一段连续的映射区间 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"[2,3]"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":" 走到 "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"2"},{"type":"text","value":"，得到一段连续的映射区间 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"[12,12]"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":" 走到 "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"1"},{"type":"text","value":"，得到一段连续的映射区间 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"[11,11]"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineMath","value":"top(u) = top(v)"},{"type":"text","value":"，得到一段连续的映射区间 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"[1,1]"},{"type":"text","value":"；相遇，终止算法"}]}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"所以，我们在映射区间里依次对 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\big\\lbrace [7,7],[2,3],[12,12],[11,11],[1,1] \\big\\rbrace"},{"type":"text","value":"\n进行操作就好了。"}]},{"type":"code","lang":"cpp","meta":"title=\"update.cpp\" linenos","value":"void update(int L, int R) {\n  while (top[L] != top[R]) {\n    // 让 dep 大的走\n    if (dep[top[L]] < dep[top[R]]) swap(L, R);\n\n    // 得到连续映射区间 [l,r]\n    int l = pos[top[L]], r = pos[L];\n\n    // 对 [l,r] 进行操作\n    fun(l, r);\n\n    L = fat[top[L]];\n  }\n  if (dep[L] > dep[R]) swap(L, R);\n  fun(pos[L], pos[R])\n}\n"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"小记"}],"identifier":"heading-小记"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"上文中讨论的是对 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"(u,v)"},{"type":"text","value":" 路径上的所有节点进行操作。若信息全维护在边上，即要对 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"(u,v)"},{"type":"text","value":" 路径上的所有边进行操作，则仅需在 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"dep(u) = dep(v)"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，执行的区间改成 "},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\Big[ pos \\big( son(u) \\big),pos(v) \\Big]"},{"type":"text","value":" 就行了。"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Related"}],"identifier":"heading-related"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"marker":42,"spread":false,"children":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"link","url":"http://blog.sina.com.cn/s/blog_6974c8b20100zc61.html","children":[{"type":"text","value":"树链剖分"}]}]}]}]},"frontmatter":{"title":"树链剖分","createdAt":"2016-04-23T07:48:27.000Z","updatedAt":"2024-02-06T02:28:06.000Z","tags":["acm","算法","树链剖分"]},"definitionMap":{"定理2":{"type":"definition","identifier"